Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:49:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ascend): split-batch scaffolding - config, envs,
 platform key strategy, plumbing

Adds the default-off SplitBatchConfig (additional_config.split_batch_config),
inplace-parallel env knobs, the fail-closed cudagraph runtime-key admission
strategy (get_cudagraph_key_strategy), forward-context metadata plumbing,
dual-slot rotary cos/sin buffers, split-batch debug/diagnostics modules, and
the split-batch feature guide.

No behavior change unless split_batch_config.enabled is set.

Requires vllm-hust >= 13f11da444 (#273: BatchDescriptor.runtime_metadata +
Platform.get_cudagraph_key_strategy contract).
